[{"id":2694274459,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6gl12b","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"I had a glance over this, and i got to admit I'm a bit overwhelmed by the amount of nontrivial changes.\r\nIf you have any idea for breaking this down, this would be welcome! Perhaps it would be possible to move all these generated strings that are checked into external files while continuing to use `pytest`, and remove `pytest` as a separate step? \r\n\r\nIf that's not possible, perhaps you could summarize the changes in each section to help the review process? Specifically, it would be interesting to know which parts need particular attention or comment and which are pretty trivial text moves.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101443#pullrequestreview-2694274459","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101443","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-18T12:08:06Z"},{"id":2708590291,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hcc7T","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"Code looks good. In those files there's a lot of redundancy going on, but it seems more readable and cleaner to me with your new version. Still, this wasn't very easy to review, so I can't 100% guarantee I would have caught all potential problems. Though given the nature of this code, hopefully it's a case of 'if it's broken, it'll show immediately'.\r\n\r\nI also rebased onto `master`, compiled the code, had a quick look at some of the generated header files, and tested if everything still worked in tps demo. \r\n\r\nI think this needs an approval from someone more involved with the build systems.\r\nPersonally, I think getting rid of pytest as a dependency sounds good if all we're doing is comparing file contents. But I don't feel qualified to make a decision about it.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101443#pullrequestreview-2708590291","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101443","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-23T15:03:06Z"},{"id":2708816354,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hdUHi","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e37b376cf22b4545&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","login":"Repiteo","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101443#pullrequestreview-2708816354","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101443","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-03-23T21:48:53Z"},{"id":2708817374,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hdUXe","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"00